      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In order to new spec, connection error about MQTT.prestep also will be handled by Cloud. It's the extension of previous spec. --------------------------------------------   To prevent too much load from MQTT requests, the retry logic has been improved as follows. For example, on July 28th, there was a Korean server failure and MQTT prestep kept retrying, which caused difficulties in resolving the failure situation.   h2. 2. Current spec It varies slightly by platform, but MQTT prestep makes unlimited requests at short intervals of about 10 to 20 seconds in case of failure. And MQTT connect makes continuous requests at 3-second intervals. h2. 3. Changed spec h4. Provisioning tables to reference   "
        }
      ]
